From 33eafc7a9e84098c61eb49514b3039f50b9a1373 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 20 Jan 2022 15:19:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-69581] pci: use device struct for dev specific data

Including device specific headers from common code is not allowed
anymore, and instead the device structures should be used.
PCI device code is refactored to use device structure.

Change-Id: Ie5a0ffbe9adf2a41925ca2d42417733db79a5f86
Signed-off-by: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
---

